00:03:00.498 --> 00:03:03.968
CITY'S BROKEN CONTRACTING SYSTEM TO MAKE SURE THAT OUR

00:03:03.968 --> 00:03:07.572
TAX DOLLARS ARE SPENT EFFICIENTLY AND TRANSPARENTLY.

00:03:07.572 --> 00:03:12.176
RIGHT NOW CITY CONTRACTING IS TOO EXPENSIVE, TOO SLOW AND TOO

00:03:12.176 --> 00:03:15.176
POLITICAL. NOT ONLY DO DIFFERENT

00:03:15.513 --> 00:03:19.917
DEPARTMENTS HAVE DIFFERENT RULES BUT MORE THAN A DOZEN

00:03:19.917 --> 00:03:23.998
DEPARTMENTS CAN BE INVOLVED IN APPROVING JUST ONE CONTRACT.

00:03:23.998 --> 00:03:28.690
THIS SLOWS DOWN PROJECTS AND DRIVES UP COSTS AND WE ALL

00:03:28.690 --> 00:03:31.673
KNOW WE CAN DO BETTER BY BRINGING CONTRACTING UNDER THE

00:03:31.673 --> 00:03:35.343
CITY ADMINISTRATOR. WE CAN SET CONSISTENT CITYWIDE

00:03:35.343 --> 00:03:38.480
STANDARDS THAT WILL CUT RED TAPE.

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:42.800
REDUCE DELAYS AND SAVE TAXPAYER DOLLARS.

00:03:42.551 --> 00:03:46.488
SECOND, WE'RE GOING TO MAKE OUR BALLOTS SHORTER AND SIMPLER.

00:03:46.488 --> 00:03:51.288
IN 2024 OUR SAN FRANCISCO HAS CONSIDERED 15 BALLOT MEASURES

00:03:54.362 --> 00:03:57.699
IN THE SAME ELECTION. OAKLAND HAD THREE, SAN JOSE HAD

00:03:57.699 --> 00:04:00.699
ONE. OUR PROPOSED CHANGES WOULD

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.380
ALLOW A MAJORITY OF THE BOARD OF SUPERVISORS TO PUT A MEASURE

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.840
ON THE BALLOT AND BRING US CLOSER TO STATE AND OTHER BAY

00:04:05.840 --> 00:04:09.440
AREA CITY STANDARDS ON SIGNATURE REQUIREMENTS.

00:04:09.978 --> 00:04:14.649
AND IT WOULD ELIMINATE THE MAYOR'S ABILITY TO UNILATERALLY

00:04:14.649 --> 00:04:18.252
PLACE A MEASURE ON THE BALLOT. THESE REFORMS WILL MOVE US

00:04:18.252 --> 00:04:22.190
IN THE RIGHT DIRECTION AND ENSURE THAT BALLOT MEASURES

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:25.190
REFLECT CITYWIDE PRIORITIES. THIRD ACCOUNTABILITY.

00:04:26.461 --> 00:04:32.461
SAN FRANCISCANS EXPECT OUR CITY TO DELIVER WORLD CLASS SERVICES

00:04:33.802 --> 00:04:34.670
. BUT RIGHT NOW OUR CHARTER

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:38.270
REWARD REWARDS BUREAUCRACY AND SCATTERS RESPONSIBILITY.

00:04:38.606 --> 00:04:42.877
THESE REFORMS WOULD CHANGE THAT TO ENSURE THAT WHEN SAN

00:04:42.877 --> 00:04:46.810
FRANCISCANS ELECT A MAYOR THEY KNOW WHO IS RESPONSIBLE FOR

00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:49.684
DELIVERING RESULTS. THEY WILL ALLOW THE MAYOR TO

00:04:49.684 --> 00:04:52.687
HIRE AND REMOVE DEPARTMENT HEADS WHILE ENSURING THAT

00:04:52.687 --> 00:04:56.291
