00:05:01.763 --> 00:05:05.967
ISN'T WORKING AS IT SHOULD. SAN FRANCISCANS ELECT PEOPLE TO

00:05:05.967 --> 00:05:09.571
RUN THEIR GOVERNMENT AND THOSE LEADERS SHOULD BE ACCOUNTABLE

00:05:09.571 --> 00:05:12.974
